{"id":"fonction","lemma":"fonction","pos":"noun","rank":2608,"glosses":["function (what something does or is used for)","role (function or position of something or someone)","function"],"ipa":"/fɔ̃k.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/18/Fr-fonction.ogg/Fr-fonction.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fonctions"},"formAudio":{"fonctions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c2/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Roptat-fonctions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est une voiture de fonction.","en":"This is a company car.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Je rentre en fonctions cet après-midi.","en":"I'm coming into the office this afternoon.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go back","l":"rentrer"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"this"},{"g":"after"},{"g":"noon, midday"}]},{"text":"Suis-je rétabli dans mes fonctions ?","en":"Am I reinstated?","words":[{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to restore","l":"rétablir"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"La fonction était intimidante.","en":"The task was daunting.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"intimidating","l":"intimidant"}]},{"text":"La fonction du cœur est de pomper le sang.","en":"The function of the heart is to pump blood.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to pump"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"blood"}]}]}